+## Request
+Implement JSON Merge Patch (RFC 7386): export `applyMergePatch(target, patch)` from `src/index.ts`.
+
+## Done
+- Non-object patch replaces the target; object patch merges recursively; `null` members delete.
+- Inputs are not mutated; `__proto__` keys are handled safely via `setMember`.
+- Tests added in `src/index.test.ts` (RFC 7386 examples, immutability, `__proto__`).
